Neither measurement tells the whole health story in isolation."}],["$","p","1",{"children":"Body-composition scales can vary with hydration and technique. Trends, waist measurement, and clinical markers can be more meaningful than a one-off reading."}]],["$","h2",null,{"children":"Use this information carefully"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Health advice works best when adapted to your own situation. A BMI result can be a useful opening measure, but it should never replace individualized medical care."}]],["$","p",null,{"className":"mt-10 rounded-xl bg-slate-100 p-4 text-sm dark:bg-slate-800","children":["This material is for education and does not replace personal medical advice. ",["$","$L5",null,{"href":"/disclaimer","className":"text-teal-700 underline","children":"Read the medical disclaimer."}]]}]]}]}]]
